  "releaseNotes": "## [ 0.11.04] 01.07.2026\n\n### Added\n- Add new Node System under `SytemEx.Model` - future replace old Node under `SystemEx.Collections.Generic`.\n    - `GenericNode`: Basi Node only Value holder\n    - `GroupedNode`: Non‑intrusive grouped node storing a value and an expandable collection\n        of associated <see cref=\"GenericNode{T}\" /> instances.\n    - `LinkedNode`: Intrusive doubly‑linked node storing a value and two directional links.\n    - `LinkedNodeSlice`: Represents a slice over intrusive  structures,\n    - `LinkedNodeWithSibling`: LinkedNode With Siblings\n    - `LinkedNodeRange`: Represents a simple range defined by a begin and end iterator over intrusive <see cref=\"Node{T}\" /> structures.  \n    - `Node`: Intrusive singly-linked node storing a value and a single forward link.\n### Fixed    \n- Fixed bug in Array ctor",
